        "original_id": "39819bae-be57-5a20-96f8-c80c4200c29d",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Harold Ramis, Bill Murray, Andie MacDowell, Chris Elliott, Jennifer Celotta\n- Works: Caddyshack, National Lampoon's Vacation, Groundhog Day, Analyze This, A Benihana Christmas\n- Roles: actor, director, writer, comedian\n\nFacts:\n- Harold Ramis was an American actor, director, writer, and comedian who lived from November 21, 1944 to February 24, 2014.\n- Harold Ramis directed the comedy film Caddyshack in 1980.\n- Harold Ramis directed the comedy film National Lampoon's Vacation in 1983.\n- Harold Ramis directed the 1993 American fantasy-comedy film Groundhog Day.\n- Groundhog Day starred Bill Murray, Andie MacDowell, and Chris Elliott.\n- Harold Ramis directed the comedy film Analyze This in 1999.\n- Jennifer Celotta wrote A Benihana Christmas, and Harold Ramis directed it.",
